#
# cva6_trace_wrap instantiates the upstream `cva6`, `cva6_rvfi` and
# `cva6_iti` modules (the CVA6-with-ITI fork) plus their `rvfi_types.svh` /
# `cvxif_types.svh` / `iti_types.svh` headers -- none of which are vendored
# in this IP tree (consolidation-plan decision: reference cores are fetched,
# not vendored; see examples/kv260/third_party/fetch.sh once that example
# lands). This project therefore does NOT resolve/elaborate standalone here;
# it is wired in wherever the fetched core sources are added to the search
# path (an examples/ CVA6 top). See rtl/adapters/cva6/README.md and
# rtl/adapters/README.md.

read_sv	cva6_trace_wrap.sv
